      "id": "XConnect.Sdk",
      "range": "*"
    },
    "message": "TwitterConnect is the legacy 1.x SDK and is no longer maintained.\n\nThe project has evolved into XConnect, a redesigned, strongly typed .NET SDK for X API v2, with improved authentication, API coverage, reliability and modern .NET support.\n\nNew development and future updates are available through XConnect.Sdk.\n\nPlease migrate to XConnect.Sdk for continued development and support.\n\nGitHub: https://github.com/mechaitanya/XConnect",
    "reasons": [
      "Legacy"
    ]
  },
  "description": "Twitter connect library checks for credentials if they are valid and helps in sending a tweet to other user's twitter handle. Twitter Connect works with Twitter API V2 and supports .net 6.",
